19,22,377,256
Map displaying all areas in current
battle sector. In some areas there
are a number of rounds remaining for
possible completion of the mission, an 
area marked by two swords is the final
area of the battle sector.
23,326,370,130
Brief information about the selected area, 
what you can expect there, and what your
task is (if there is any).
418,8,135,420
Unit selection area for attack. The
number of units per attack is limited
by your rank. Right mouse click on
unit's name displays information
about it.
422,441,70,27
Start attack - you need to 
select a territory and units 
before the attack
497,441,70,27
Cancel attack